 Money in your career is a simulation, not a real contract quote. Going undrafted still leads to a camp signing.%0A        </p>%0A        <button%0A          class="_helpClose_6a09aa"%0A        >%0A          Got it%0A        </button>%0A      </div>%0A      <div%0A        class="_playArea_6a09aa"%0A      >%0A        <h3%0A          class="sr-only"%0A          tabindex="-1"%0A        >%0A          Your career starts here.%0A        </h3>%0A        <div%0A          class="_routes_6a09aa"%0A        >%0A          <button%0A            class="_route_6a09aa"%0A          >%0A            <span%0A              class="_routeTop_6a09aa"%0A            >%0A              <span>%0A                1%0A                 %0A                season%0A              </span>%0A              <svg%0A                class="lucide lucide-arrow-right"%0A                fill="none"%0A                height="19"%0A                stroke="currentColor"%0A                stroke-linecap="round"%0A                stroke-linejoin="round"%0A                stroke-width="2"%0A                viewBox="0 0 24 24"%0A                width="19"%0A                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"%0A              >%0A                <path%0A                  d="M5 12h14"%0A                />%0A                <path%0A                  d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"%0A                />%0A              </svg>%0A            </span>%0A            <strong>%0A              One year of college%0A            </strong>%0A            <span>%0A              One season on campus, then you declare.%0A            </span>%0A            <small>%0A              Start at age %0A              18%0A               · Draft at %0A              19%0A            </small>%0A          </button>%0A          <button%0A            class="_route_6a09aa"%0A          >%0A            <span%0A              class="_routeTop_6a09aa"%0A            >%0A              <span>%0A                3%0A                 %0A                seasons%0A              </spa